.TH "idevicesetlocation" 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
idevicesetlocation \- Simulate location on iOS device.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B idevicesetlocation
[OPTIONS] -- <LAT> <LONG>

.B idevicesetlocation
[OPTIONS] reset

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"

Simulate location on iOS device with mounted developer disk image.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-udid UDID
target specific device by UDID
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-network
connect to network device
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
enable communication debugging
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
prints usage information
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
prints version information.

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Nikias Bassen

.SH ON THE WEB
https://libimobiledevice.org

https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libimobiledevice
